text hintNPCBattle3SmallHint_text {

    "Start by figuring out how you're going\n"
    "to deal with Lapras.\p"
    "Even if you're immune to its 2 damaging\n"
    "attacks, you faint to Perish song.\p"
    "Can anything be done\n"
    "about Perish Song?"


}

text hintNPCBattle3MedHint_text {

    "Losing HP from Pain Split will not\n"
    "pop a Pokémon's held Air Balloon."

}

text hintNPCBattle3LargeHint_text {

    "Gallade should begin its fight\n"
    "against Lapras with 44 HP.\p"
    "After one move, Gallade should be\n"
    "immune to all of Lapras's attacks."

}

text secondAbilities_text {

    "Some Pokémon have additional abilities!\p"
    "These function normally, except\n"
    "they can't be swapped with Skill Swap."

}

text upload_text {

    "When a Pokémon with the ability Upload\n"
    "faints, it uploads its current type.\p"
    "The next move used by an ally then\n"
    "becomes that type until switching out."

}

text conversion2_text {

    "Conversion 2 now changes the user's\n"
    "type to a single, guaranteed type.\p"
    "Type changes are as follows\n"
    "(Last Dmg Type --> New User Type):\p"
    "Grass --> Fire\n"
    "Ice --> Water\p"
    "Fighting --> Flying\n"
    "Poison --> Rock\p"
    "Ground --> Grass\n"
    "Flying --> Electric\p"
    "Normal --> Steel\n"
    "Water --> Dragon"

}

text porygonZAI_text {

    "Porygon-Z will only and always use\n"
    "Pain Split when it is below half max HP\l"
    "and its opponent has more HP.\p"
    "Otherwise, Porygon-Z will default to\n"
    "using Conversion 2, if it still has PP."

}

text airBalloon_text {

    "A held Air Balloon will now also pop when\n"
    "the holder receives indirect damage,\l"
    "such as from Rocky Helmet recoil."

}

text unnerveCapsule_text {

    "This changes the selected Pokémon's\n"
    "ability to Unnerve when used in battle.\p"
    "The ability change is lost when the\n"
    "Pokémon switches out."

}

text Battle3_Intro_text {

    "So, you're the one who's been\n"
    "harboring that rogue Munchlax?\p"
    "Surely you know how much Team Shuckle\n"
    "has been looking for that, right?\p"
    "Now, hand over the Munchlax before\n"
    "I take it from you by force!"

}

text Battle3_Short_text {

    "Hand over that Munchlax or\n"
    "prepare to face the music!"

}

text Battle3_Lose_text {

    "Aww shucks!"

}

text Battle3_PostBattle_text {

    "You want to leave this island, right?\n"
    "Then heed my advice.\p"
    "Take that Munchlax with you and stay\n"
    "out of Team Shuckle's way!\p"
    "The next time you interfere with us\.\n"
    "Let's just say things won't go as well."

}

text SignIce_text{

    "There's an invisible bridge to the\n"
    "right over the adjacent ice puzzle.\p"
    "Use it to get a better view!"

}